---Basic Aggregate Functions
---1. Find the total count of distinct manufacturers in the table.
SELECT distinct manufacturer from Product;

---2. Calculate the total price of all products where the Product_Type is 'Furniture'.
select sum(price) from PRODUCT where Product_Type ='Furniture';

---3. Find the average price of all products whose SellerName is 'TechWorld'.
select AVG(price) from PRODUCT where SellerName = 'TechWorld';

---4. Determine the maximum price of products sold by 'AudioStore'.
select max(price) from PRODUCT where SellerName = 'AudioStore';

---5. Find the minimum price of any product in the Appliances category.
select min(price) from PRODUCT where Product_Type ='Appliances';

